                                "sense_id": "093235d8-e89f-313b-9445-77a71219fb43",
                                "text": "“You know all, then?”—“I know nothing,” said Melmoth faultering."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7b11092-2db3-4a2c-a914-9610367c5608",
                                "sense_id": "093235d8-e89f-313b-9445-77a71219fb43",
                                "text": "The penitent shower fell, as down he knelt\nBefore that care-worn sage, who trembling felt\nAbout his large dark locks, and faultering spake:\nArise, good youth, for sacred Phoebus’ sake!"
                            }
